---
description: Protected branches, pull requests, and secret handling for this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

`develop` is the integration branch. Cut work from `develop` on a `feature/<short-name>` branch and land it through a pull request. Do not force-push `develop`, `ppe`, or `prod`.

Do not commit secrets. Credentials belong in Azure DevOps secret variables or a local `.env` file. `.env.example` lists names only. Do not read `.env`, `.pem`, or `.key` files into the chat.

CI is test-only. Do not add `databricks bundle deploy` to `azure-pipelines.yml` or `.github/workflows/ci.yml`. CD stays manual and gated.
